      "message": "These tests are great and provide good coverage for the wiring of the callbacks.\n\nWhat they don\u0027t provide is coverage for the code in CS. For example, this patch provides the coverage to ensure that when CS calls the agent, the wiring is done correctly so that the implementations learn about it, but we have no coverage for CS actually calling the agent when the network disconnects. Such tests should probably be written separately, as the coverage here is specific to NetworkAgent.\n",
